      "id": "claim_aa4b01f857934a6dbcc398aa0c3355c0",
      "statement": "ROSA Boundary separates CLI orchestration and operator authentication from Lambda-side authorization/resource provisioning and ECS Fargate task execution; the CLI's centralized PersistentPreRunE hook (commandPreRun, wired in buildRootCommand) performs OIDC-to-STS authentication and selects the Lambda invoker role for the investigation-create and session-create commands versus the shared SRE role for other commands.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://cmd/rosa-boundary/main.go#L7-L9",
