    {
      "id": "claim_e819d502dcdc4516a878085bbb3dfec1",
      "statement": "The reap-investigations Lambda's GRACE_PERIOD_HOURS defaults to 72 hours in the handler when the environment variable is unset, while the Terraform variable investigation_grace_period_hours that normally supplies it defaults to 168 hours (7 days); operators relying on the Lambda's built-in fallback outside Terraform-managed deployment get a materially shorter grace period than the documented default.",
