      "id": "claim_122462732b204913a3b8320e863778d4",
      "statement": "The repository also contains components/trusted-actions, a Trusted Actions service built as a fully separate Go module (github.com/openshift-online/rosa-trusted-actions), its own container image build, and its own Terraform roots (components/trusted-actions/terraform/global and .../regional); no code path in the create-investigation Lambda, the regional ECS task definition, or entrypoint.sh references Trusted Actions, so the Boundary investigation container's architectural reachability to TA's execution API is unbuilt and unwired, not an existing integration.",
